        "content": "\n<div style=\"padding:6px 2px 0 2px;\">\n  <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-end;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:10px;\">\n    <div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:11px;color:#6b7280;margin-bottom:4px;\">Open Platform OBS</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.15;\">可观测入口</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:#4b5563;margin-top:4px;line-height:1.45;\">VictoriaMetrics / Logs / Traces + Grafana,为 AI Agent 提供只读查询与调试接口。首页只保留入口与全局脉搏。</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:10px;\">\n    <div style=\"border:1px solid #c7d2fe;border-radius:999px;padding:12px 18px;background:#eef4ff;min-height:0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\">\n      <div style=\"text-align:center;\">\n        <div style=\"font-size:22px;color:#1d4ed8;font-weight:800;line-height:1.1;\">观测数据</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:#5b6b91;margin-top:4px;\">Metrics / Logs / Traces</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"border:1px solid #bbf7d0;border-radius:999px;padding:12px 18px;background:#effdf4;min-height:0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\">\n      <div style=\"text-align:center;\">\n        <div style=\"font-size:22px;color:#047857;font-weight:800;line-height:1.1;\">告警与拨测</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:#537566;margin-top:4px;\">vmalert / Alertmanager / Blackbox</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"border:1px solid #fed7aa;border-radius:999px;padding:12px 18px;background:#fff7ed;min-height:0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\">\n      <div style=\"text-align:center;\">\n        <div style=\"font-size:22px;color:#c2410c;font-weight:800;line-height:1.1;\">MCP 接入</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a6b53;margin-top:4px;\">AI Agent 只读查询接口</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\